bashrun \- http://bashrun.sourceforge.net
.PP
xdotool \- http://www.semicomplete.com/projects/xdotool
.PP
dict \- http://www.dict.org
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR Xorg (1),
.BR xterm (1),
.BR xdotool (1),
.BR dict (1),
.BR stty (1),
